# Force every request on the Netlify subdomain (and any www host) onto the
# real domain, permanently. Without this the site is reachable at a
# hosting-company URL that leaks into search results and looks nothing
# like the brand. The trailing ! makes the redirect win even though the
# file exists at both hosts.
https://njforeclosure-guide.netlify.app/* https://njforeclosureguide.org/:splat 301!
http://njforeclosure-guide.netlify.app/* https://njforeclosureguide.org/:splat 301!
https://www.njforeclosureguide.org/* https://njforeclosureguide.org/:splat 301!
http://www.njforeclosureguide.org/* https://njforeclosureguide.org/:splat 301!
